&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3919&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a1430b6e3c3e&quot;&gt;Issue, maintain and releas ERP based inspection plans incl. allocated attributes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4003&quot; data-local-id=&quot;51dd4d619f0c&quot;&gt;Review and analytics on manufacturing data to identify recurrent issues and drive efficient root cause corrective action and improvement initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
