&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4307&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cfa1f6f586b9&quot;&gt;Consult and support production teams on any Quality topic, and contribute to internal and external audits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4416&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a95db868eae1&quot;&gt;Support the development, monitoring and review of KPI’s via e.g. SQCDP in your area across different management levels&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4538&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ef4d8cf28052&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance to internal QMS, EN9100 and others applicable standards&lt;/p&gt;
