&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4644&quot; data-local-id=&quot;845ac77a3ea8&quot;&gt;Carry a Technical or Quality related education / study with min. 5 years of quality management experience in a similar role within electronics, machinery or plant engineering, automotive, or aerospace&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4849&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f13d6a681da5&quot;&gt;Deliver applied experience on SAP Insepction planning, Q-Methods and tools like APQP, SQCDP, 8D/9S, Lean, can be proven by certificate, and a good understanding of special processes is of advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5051&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9c65cfc2dcbb&quot;&gt;Own Capability to read, understand, and apply technical and procedural documents ( Engineering drawings / Inspection procedures / industry Norms ) and experience in maintaining IT Software applications MS Office, QA SW if applicable. SAP experience is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5317&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f7f6f8809600&quot;&gt;Can work independently as well in a team and subordinate him/herself with the ability to assert oneself and respect other positions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5452&quot; data-local-id=&quot;64dbe2336b69&quot;&gt;Maintain a process oriented attitude and mindset with flexibility and creativity to achieve given goals in quality and on time&lt;/p&gt;
