&lt;li id=&quot;E257&quot; class=&quot;qowt-li-2_0 qowt-list x-scope qowt-word-para-8&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;E258&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font2-Roboto&quot;&gt;Responsible for finding new business opportunities in the real estate space in Spain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;E259&quot; class=&quot;qowt-li-2_0 qowt-list x-scope qowt-word-para-8&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;E260&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font2-Roboto&quot;&gt;Establish and maintain strong relationships with companies in the real estate eco-system, understanding their needs, business model, and client base.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
