&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;E285&quot; class=&quot;x-scope qowt-word-para-5&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;E286&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font2-Roboto&quot;&gt;Industry leading compensation and the opportunity to quickly increase your earnings through a transparent compensation scheme.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
