&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;with an estimated annual earnings range of $52,000 to $81,900 that is paid hourly for someone who works 25-35 hours on the platform each week for the full year.&lt;/li&gt;
